{"availability":"available","full":"eQuantic/equantic-ui","name":"equantic-ui","description":"Write components once in C#; realize them as DOM and CSS on the web or as GPU pixels on macOS, iOS, Android and Windows. No JavaScript, no Swift, no platform files, one .NET SDK.","category":"Design","language":"C#","stars":8,"forks":2,"created":"2026-01-22T15:58:49Z","updated":"2026-10-17T15:20:25Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://ui.equantic.tech","topics":["android","aspnetcore","component-library","cross-platform","csharp","design-system","dotnet","flutter-inspired","gpu-rendering","ios","macos","metal","roslyn","ssr","transpiler","typescript","ui-framework","vulkan","windows","write-once"],"demo":"https://ui.equantic.tech/playground","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T18:53:53.112Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T18:53:53.112Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T18:53:53.112Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T22:13:46.060Z","stars":7,"forks":2},{"at":"2026-10-04T08:17:39.316Z","stars":7,"forks":2},{"at":"2026-10-06T16:29:45.021Z","stars":7,"forks":2},{"at":"2026-10-08T20:07:50.258Z","stars":8,"forks":2},{"at":"2026-10-11T06:14:00.237Z","stars":8,"forks":2},{"at":"2026-10-17T18:53:53.112Z","stars":8,"forks":2}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Write components once in C#. On the web they compile to optimized JavaScript at build time — no WASM.","Natively they render through Photon, our own GPU engine on Metal and Vulkan — no WebView, no Skia.","And the part of the vocabulary an email can hold renders as email-safe HTML, with its plain-text twin."],"features":["One abstract vocabulary (Box, Row, Column, Stack, Text, TextEntry, ScrollView, Overlay, …) and three realizers: the web (server-rendered DOM, hydrated in the browser), Photon (GPU pixels) and email (tables and inline…","Web: every declaration becomes one atomic CSS rule, deduplicated app-wide, so the","hundredth card adds no CSS. The server and the client hash declarations identically, so hydration never repaints. Hover and focus become real CSS pseudo-classes: interaction visuals with no JavaScript.","Native: the same values resolve to device pixels and GPU paint. No CSS exists on this path.","Theming is one IAppTheme. Add the Material package and MaterialTheme.FromSeed(...)"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/eQuantic/equantic-ui/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"1be1d9088272ed1edbe13122bcedb645ab7cc24805ad0e3926892fd00a2d50f1","extractedAt":"2026-10-17T18:53:53.199Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T18:53:53.199Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Write components once in C#. On the web they compile to optimized JavaScript at build time — no WASM.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/eQuantic/equantic-ui/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"1be1d9088272ed1edbe13122bcedb645ab7cc24805ad0e3926892fd00a2d50f1","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/eQuantic/equantic-ui/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-17T18:53:53.199Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-17T15:20:25Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/eQuantic/equantic-ui/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-17T18:53:53.201Z","hash":"1be1d9088272ed1edbe13122bcedb645ab7cc24805ad0e3926892fd00a2d50f1","originalBytes":25831,"storedBytes":25831,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T18:53:53.112Z","qualityPriority":false,"enrichmentAttemptAt":"2026-10-05T01:00:53.125Z","latestRelease":null,"releaseCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T01:00:53.125Z","screenshots":[{"src":"previews/f8d29e1a47114b5351437cfd.jpg","kind":"demo","capturedAt":"2026-10-17T19:12:06.123Z","url":"https://ui.equantic.tech/playground"}],"previewAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T19:12:06.123Z","demoHealth":{"url":"https://ui.equantic.tech/playground","attemptedAt":"2026-10-17T19:12:06.123Z","status":"working","checkedAt":"2026-10-17T19:12:06.123Z","lastWorkingAt":"2026-10-17T19:12:06.123Z","target":"https://